      "versionNonce": 1643455552,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785424333820,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "At line P.length = 100; it will definetly change the value of length from 10 to 100\nthis may look like pass by value but it is still pass by value as copy of reference is passed \nthey both passed to same reference .\n\nHowever at line P=new Box(100,100,100);\nP gonna point to another object but still the ref b3 will gonna point same object (1000)\nthus here it doesn't affect the actual parameter thus we say it is pass by value.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "At line P.length = 100; it will definetly change the value of length from 10 to 100\nthis may look like pass by value but it is still pass by value as copy of reference is passed \nthey both passed to same reference .\n\nHowever at line P=new Box(100,100,100);\nP gonna point to another object but still the ref b3 will gonna point same object (1000)\nthus here it doesn't affect the actual parameter thus we say it is pass by value.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
